                        "entry_id": "c1dd4e15-eab0-3457-90b4-7f0dd281f92f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "long underwear, long johns, that is worn either under normal clothing in cold weather, or as a night dress."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "plural-only"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a8594f88-fd32-46cc-be7b-0015b1882070",
                                "sense_id": "a857f769-4184-333d-ad4d-ee8027d1be8b",
                                "text": "Я то́лько не понима́ю одного́: как чо́порные англича́нки, к кото́рым в спа́льню не сме́ет войти́ родно́й брат, при кото́рых нельзя́ произнести́ сло́во «пантало́ны», живу́т ме́жду э́тим народонаселе́нием, кото́рое хо́дит во́все без пантало́н?",
                                "translation": "There is only one thing I do not understand: how can the prim English women whose own brothers don't dare enter their bedrooms, before whom one may not use the word \"pants,\" live among this population, of which some wear no pants at all?",
                                "english": "There is only one thing I do not understand: how can the prim English women whose own brothers don't dare enter their bedrooms, before whom one may not use the word \"pants,\" live among this population, of which some wear no pants at all?"
                            }
